    {
      "id": "claim_be5d685933fe42f7bcc9c231d9a296a6",
      "statement": "Notable schema conventions: TEXT + CHECK is used for user-editable enum-like fields (e.g. truck_cap_table.participant) instead of pgEnum to avoid enum-migration cost; salary_periods.isDefault defaults are enforced transactionally in the route handler rather than via partial unique index; the project uses pgvector (vector(1536)) for FAQ embeddings via the vectorColumn1536 helper.",
