    {
      "id": "claim_8617b351cd144af68b21e35124ba7331",
      "statement": "Migrations are generated with pnpm db:generate (drizzle-kit generate, schema diff → new file under backend/drizzle/), applied with pnpm db:migrate, and inspected with pnpm db:studio; production migrations live under deploy/ and use a wrapper that excludes *.revert.sql files (commit 45fbad3).",
